{
  "uid": "metrics-container-real",
  "title": "真实容器 · Compose 资源限制验证",
  "description": "从当前 Python 容器 cgroup v2 读取真实用量与限制，验证 Compose 资源配置。",
  "tags": [
    "metrics-sdk",
    "real-cgroup",
    "docker"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "5s",
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "真实数据 · 读取当前容器 cgroup v2",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "此页读取 **Python 容器真实 cgroup v2**，不是三实例模拟值。**当前限制以本页下方“CPU 配额”和“内存上限”数据卡为准，随容器配置自动读取。**\n\nCPU 配额 = `cpu.max` 的 quota/period；内存上限 = `memory.max`；用量来自 `cpu.stat usage_usec` 与 `memory.current`。显示当前 cgroup 本级限制，无上限不显示百分比。更改 Compose 后用 `up -d simulator` 应用，等待约 5～10 秒后刷新本页；查看当前值时保持时间范围结束于 now。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "CPU 配额 · 真实核数",
      "description": "实际读取当前容器 cgroup v2；不使用模拟数值。",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "suffix: cores",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "无数据 / 未配置限制"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "costrict_cgroup_cpu_quota_cores{app=\"metrics-simulator\",source=\"real-cgroup\"}",
          "legendFormat": "真实容器",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
